@startuml

title Dikaios Amanah - Business Verification Sequence Diagram

hide footbox

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    MessageAlign center
    ParticipantPadding 20
    BoxPadding 8
    ArrowThickness 1
}

actor "Business Owner" as BO
actor "Administrator" as ADMIN

participant "Web Interface" as UI
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "Verification Service" as VS
database "Database" as DB
participant "Audit Service" as AUDIT
participant "Notification Service" as NOTIFY


== Submit Verification ==

BO -> UI : Submit business verification
UI -> API : Submit verification data
API -> VS : Validate request
VS -> DB : Store verification
DB --> VS : Verification ID

VS -> AUDIT : Record submission
AUDIT -> DB : Store audit record

VS --> API : Submission successful
API --> UI : Verification submitted
UI --> BO : Show confirmation


== Administrator Review ==

ADMIN -> UI : Open pending verification
UI -> API : Request verification
API -> VS : Retrieve verification
VS -> DB : Query verification
DB --> VS : Verification details
VS --> API : Verification details
API --> UI : Display verification
UI --> ADMIN : Show verification


== Review Decision ==

ADMIN -> UI : Approve or reject
UI -> API : Submit decision
API -> VS : Process decision

VS -> DB : Update verification status
DB --> VS : Update successful

VS -> AUDIT : Record review decision
AUDIT -> DB : Store audit record

VS -> NOTIFY : Send verification result
NOTIFY -> DB : Store notification

VS --> API : Review completed
API --> UI : Display result
UI --> ADMIN : Show completion status

NOTIFY --> BO : Verification result notification

@enduml